<title>USA: Lyondell Petrochemical Co Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Lyondell Petrochemical Co Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.66		    $0.34</p>
<p> Net			 52,000		   27,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,401,000		1,143,000</p>
<p>		     Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.58		    $4.86</p>
<p> Net			126,000		  486,000</p>
<p> Revs		   5,052,000		4,936,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  80,000		   80,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 Q4 net includes gains of $20 million from asset sales and $19 million from settlement of claim associated with pipeline fire that shut down olefins plant in third quarter, offsetting the cost of the event and, in effect, transferring earnings to Q4.</p>
<p>Lyondell began accounting for Lyondell-Citgo Refining Co Ltd on equity basis January 1. On a proforma basis, this would have reduced 1996 year revenues to $2.64 bln, leaving net unchanged.  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
